/*
 * Translate browser-window commands into document navigation.
 *
 * URL entry, Home, Go, Jump and Search produce loads for the document group;
 * page notifications update the window title, URL field and navigation buttons.
 * The recent-history menu stores frame-tree snapshots supplied by
 * URLDocumentHistory.goc, allowing an entire frameset to be revisited.
 * Per-document Back/Forward stacks live there instead. Editor launch and
 * clear-cache commands are also handled here.
 */

